        "en": "Label: use with caution in older adults, usually starting at the low end of the dose range."
      },
      "quote": "Of the patients receiving Risedronate sodium delayed-release in postmenopausal osteoporosis studies, 59% were 65 and over, while 13% were 75 and over.",
